# 2. PROJECT VISION

SENTINEL-XR is an AI-powered immersive cybersecurity operations platform that transforms traditional cybersecurity monitoring into an interactive spatial experience.

The platform combines:

1. Augmented Reality — visualize cybersecurity infrastructure and threats in physical space.
2. Virtual Reality — enter a fully immersive 3D Security Operations Center.
3. Artificial Intelligence — identify suspicious activity, classify threats, explain incidents, and recommend security responses.
4. Machine Learning — analyze traffic features and detect anomalous behavior.
5. Real-time Communication — synchronize the web application, AR application, VR application, and backend.
6. Cybersecurity Simulation — generate controlled, synthetic security incidents for investigation and training.

### Core product statement

"See threats in your physical environment. Enter your network in virtual reality. Understand and respond to cyber incidents with AI."

The same simulated cybersecurity environment must be accessible through the web interface, AR experience, and VR experience.

All three environments must communicate with the same backend and reflect the same actual application state.

